# ── Corpus and derived artefacts ─────────────────────────────────────────
# The whole AWS bucket lands here (~3.2 GB for 2016-2024). Never commit any of it:
#   data/raw/pdfs/         downloaded judgment PDFs
#   data/raw/metadata/     Parquet metadata
#   data/processed/        extracted text + segmented JSON
#   data/embeddings/       .npy vectors
#   data/index/            FAISS index + case_id mapping
#   data/eval/             queries, qrels, TREC run files, BM25 cache
#   data/reports/          measurement reports written by scripts/eval/*
data/
Data/
*.index
*.npy
*.parquet
*.tar

# Evaluation outputs, wherever they are written
qrels.txt
run_*.txt
per_query_scores.json
bm25_corpus.json

# ── Logs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
